# FloodSense 🌊

## Project Overview
FloodSense is a smart flood monitoring and early warning system.

## Objectives
- Monitor water levels.
- Detect rising water levels.
- Generate alerts during flood conditions.
- Help reduce flood damage.

## Hardware Components
- ESP32
- Ultrasonic Sensor
- Water Level Sensor
- Buzzer

## Technologies Used
- Arduino IDE
- Embedded C++
- ESP32

## Features
- Real-time water level monitoring
- Flood detection
- Alert notification

